ssional tournament. Therefore, the answer **‘3’ (Tennis court) is correct**.'}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 90, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2093.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2094.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2095.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2096.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2097.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2122.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2123.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2124.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2125.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2126.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2127.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2128.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2129.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2130.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2131.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2132.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2133.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2134.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2135.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2136.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2137.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2138.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2139.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf5N9S3jAA/frames/frame_2140.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/Xjf